#N canvas 50 50 1100 900 10;
#X text 20 5 String - a bowed string after Jaffedrone's: a waveguide kept ringing by a noise bow \, with a jawari bridge (Buzz: a loud note buzzes) and stiffness (Stiff: the partials stretch). Breath is the bow: harder is louder and brighter \, and buzzes more. Knobs: Bright \, Buzz \, Stiff \, Sustain;
